<title>UK: Gowrings rejects Guinness Peat offer.</title>
<headline>Gowrings rejects Guinness Peat offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK motor dealerships to fast food company Gowrings Plc rejected an offer from Guinness Peat on Tuesday describing it as unwelcome, without commercial logic and failing to reflect its true value.</p>
<p>Guinness Peat, a UK life assurance to investment company, said on Monday it hoped to extend weekend talks with a view to securing a recommendation from Gowrings at a price of not less than 90 pence per share cash with a loan note alternative.</p>
<p>But Gowrings said the approach was uninvited and advised its shareholders to take no action.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
